  "intro": [
    "Every ECS operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane does with it.",
    "Requests are JSON with an `X-Amz-Target` naming the action, signed with the `ecs`",
    "credential scope; there is no console action.",
    "With Docker `RunTask` starts real containers and a task reports `PROVISIONING`",
    "first; without it — the usual case, and the one the tests run against — a task is",
    "recorded `RUNNING` at once, so nothing here pulls an image. A stable cluster, task",
    "definition and service carry the read and update rows; delete actions and",
    "lifecycle tests make their own. `UpdateTaskProtection` only accepts a task that",
    "belongs to a service, and the four agent operations are acknowledgments."
  ],
